{"4202840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Graveyard Shift", "steam_appid": 4202840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Graveyard Shift</strong> </i>is an adrenaline pumping zombie shooter about unleashing carnage on your coworkers. Wield office supplies as your weapons against waves of the undead and survive for as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you'll utilize staplers, water-coolers, printers and more to claw your way through the <strong>increasingly difficult</strong> rounds of reanimated dogs. Circle back after death, since dying is above your paygrade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield numerous <strong>office-themed weapons</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill zombies for cash</strong> to spend around a <strong>hand-crafted map</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> your arsenal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chug sodas to <strong>buff yourself</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair barricades to stave off the zombie horde.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave through crowds of crowds of <strong>increasingly stronger</strong> zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jam out to a fast-paced <strong>drum and bass</strong> soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your friends' <strong>high scores</strong> and rack up personal records.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die</strong>, <strong>rinse</strong>, <strong>repeat</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Graveyard Shift</strong> </i>is an adrenaline pumping zombie shooter about unleashing carnage on your coworkers. Wield office supplies as your weapons against waves of the undead and survive for as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you'll utilize staplers, water-coolers, printers and more to claw your way through the <strong>increasingly difficult</strong> rounds of reanimated dogs. Circle back after death, since dying is above your paygrade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield numerous <strong>office-themed weapons</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill zombies for cash</strong> to spend around a <strong>hand-crafted map</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> your arsenal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chug sodas to <strong>buff yourself</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair barricades to stave off the zombie horde.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave through crowds of crowds of <strong>increasingly stronger</strong> zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jam out to a fast-paced <strong>drum and bass</strong> soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your friends' <strong>high scores</strong> and rack up personal records.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die</strong>, <strong>rinse</strong>, <strong>repeat</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Graveyard Shift is an adrenaline-pumping solo zombie shooter about unleashing carnage on your coworkers. Wield office supplies as deadly weapons against endless waves of the blood moon, at a job where dying is above your paygrade.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202840/492c07ab762ca4fa201cbef56f7db474b1cd1729/header.jpg?t=1774061520", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a